DESCRIPTION:<ul style="list-style: none\; margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; font-size: 14px\;">\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n    <ul style="list-style: none\; margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; font-size: 14px\;">\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n        <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">To access the 2026 Planning Board Agendas\, click on this link and download a pdf of today’s meeting:<a href="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/pb-agendas-2023/information/" title="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/pb-agendas-2023/information/" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;"></a></span></p>\n        </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;"><a href="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/" title="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;">https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/&nbsp\;</a></li>\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n        <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;">In accordance with N.J.S.A 10:4-12\, the “Open Public Meetings Act\,” be advised the following items will be heard at a meeting of the Jersey City Planning Board\, scheduled for Tuesday at 5:30 pm</span></p>\n        </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n        <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;">&nbsp\;</span><b style="text-align: justify\; font-weight: bold !important\; font-family: Arial !important\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">Zoom link to join meeting:</span></b><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\; text-align: justify\;"></span></p>\n        </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n        <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;"></span></p>\n        <div>\n        <p style="line-height: normal\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\; text-align: justify\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">Join from PC\, Mac\, iPad\, or Android:</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;"></span></p>\n        <div>\n        <p style="line-height: normal\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\; text-align: justify\;"><a href="https://protect.checkpoint.com/v2/r01/___https:/us02web.zoom.us/j/83450838695___.YXAzOmFsYW1waS1sYXc6YzpvZmZpY2UzNjVfZW1haWxzX2F0dGFjaG1lbnQ6NjM5NmY0ZDZhNGFiY2NlYTZlNGE1MGQ5ZmNhMzkxMTU6NzplZWVkOjQ5ZDhlOGM3ZGUzN2YzYTVlNWFkNzc5NjY5NzM5YmNhYzI0NDAxMWU2ODJlZWMwNmMyYmU5YTliMGQyMGJlZTY6cDpUOk4" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83450838695</span></a><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;"></span></p>\n        <div>\n        <p style="line-height: normal\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\; text-align: justify\;"><b style="font-weight: bold !important\; font-family: Arial !important\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">Webinar ID: 834 5083 8695</span></b></p>\n        <p style="line-height: normal\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\; text-align: justify\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">International numbers available: </span><a href="https://protect.checkpoint.com/v2/r01/___https:/us02web.zoom.us/u/kd9Vkz6lYV___.YXAzOmFsYW1waS1sYXc6YzpvZmZpY2UzNjVfZW1haWxzX2F0dGFjaG1lbnQ6NjM5NmY0ZDZhNGFiY2NlYTZlNGE1MGQ5ZmNhMzkxMTU6Nzo0ZWJkOjM0Y2M1YWMxZmY3ZmQxMWI2ZTUwMzhlZjAxYjZkNDBjMTNhY2QzYTU1MzhkNDg3MjQzMjlkYzA3ZGE2ZTdlZTU6cDpUOk4" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;"><span style="font-family: &quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\, serif\;">https://us02web.zoom.us/u/kd9Vkz6lYV</span></a></p>\n        </div>\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">ADVISORIES<br>\n        The Board Chair may change the order in which the agenda items are called.<br>\n        Any questions can be directed to the City Planning main line during business hours at 000-000-0000 or via email at name@example.org. Staff will not be available by phone or in the office during the meeting. You can find more information available at <a href="https://www.jerseycitynj.gov/cityhall/housinganddevelopment/cityplanning" title="jerseycitynj.gov/planning" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;">jerseycitynj.gov/planning.</a></span></p>\n        </div>\n        </li>\n        <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n        <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n        <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">To access and download digital plans\, this agenda has hyperlinks below to where you can find digital plans\, reports and other materials for all applications to be presented. Within the agenda\, click on a link for the case you wish to review. Alternatively\, you can search by address or case number to review digital plans at the Jersey City Data Portal.</span></p>\n        </div>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n    </div>\n    </li>\n</ul>
