DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/senior-freeze-information-application-assistance-tickets-1999419252808?aff=oddtdtcreator" title="Register Here">Register Here</a><br>\n<br>\n<div class="StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__structuredContent StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__text" data-testid="text-content" style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; color: rgb(88\, 81\, 99)\; text-overflow: ellipsis\; letter-spacing: 0.1px\; align-self: stretch\; line-height: 23.94px\; overflow: hidden\;">\n<div style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<p style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;">Join Mayor James Solomon for an info-session focused on available property tax relief programs\, including Senior Freeze\, ANCHOR\, and Stay NJ.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__structuredContent StructuredModuleRenderer-module-scss-module__Qv95HW__text" data-testid="text-content" style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; color: rgb(88\, 81\, 99)\; text-overflow: ellipsis\; letter-spacing: 0.1px\; align-self: stretch\; line-height: 23.94px\; overflow: hidden\;">\n<div style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<p style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;">City representatives will be available to explain the Senior Freeze Program\, answer questions\, review eligibility requirements\, and help eligible residents complete and submit their applications.</p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;"><span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;"><strong>What is Senior Freeze?</strong></span><br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\nThe Senior Freeze Program reimburses eligible homeowners for certain increases in their property taxes by comparing taxes paid in a qualifying base year with those paid in the current year.</p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;">Residents can also learn more about other available New Jersey property tax relief programs\, including:<br>\n<br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;"><strong>ANCHOR</strong></span> — Provides property tax relief to eligible New Jersey homeowners and renters.<br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;"><strong>Stay NJ</strong></span> — Provides additional property tax relief for eligible New Jersey seniors.</p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;">Residents seeking application assistance are encouraged to bring relevant documents\, including<br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n- <span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">P</span><span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">roof of age or disability</span><br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">- Recent property tax bills</span><br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">- Income documentation</span><br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">- Social Security information</span><br style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">\n<span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">- Prior Senior Freeze applications or determination letters.</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;">This session is free and open to Jersey City residents. Registration is encouraged.</p>\n<p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px\; padding: 0px 0px 12px\;"><span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">Have Questions? Contact Resident Response Center - </span><span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">(</span><span style="margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\;">000-000-0000.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>
