DESCRIPTION:<ul style="list-style: none\; margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; font-size: 14px\;">\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n    <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">To access the 2026 Planning Board Agendas\, click on this link and download a pdf of today’s meeting:<a href="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/pb-agendas-2023/information/" title="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/pb-agendas-2023/information/" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;"></a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;"><a href="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/" title="https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/">https://data.jerseycitynj.gov/explore/dataset/planning-board-agendas-2026/information/&nbsp\;</a></li>\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n    <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\;">In accordance with N.J.S.A 10:4-12\, the “Open Public Meetings Act\,” be advised the following items will be heard at a meeting of the Jersey City Planning Board\, scheduled for Tuesday at 5:30 pm in the Boardroom at the Holloway Building\, City Hall Annex\, 4 Jackson Square\, Jersey City\, NJ 07305. The building is also known as 39 Kearney Avenue\, Jersey City\, NJ 07305.</span></p>\n    <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">ADVISORIES<br>\n    No new matter involving an applicant will be started after 10PM. At 10PM the Board Chair will decide and advise applicants whether they will be heard. If an applicant cannot be heard because of the lateness of the hour\, the matter will be carried over to the next regularly scheduled meeting with preservation of notice.<br>\n    The Board Chair may change the order in which the agenda items are called.<br>\n    Any questions can be directed to the City Planning main line during business hours at 000-000-0000 or via email at name@example.org. Staff will not be available by phone or in the office during the meeting. You can find more information available at&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.jerseycitynj.gov/cityhall/housinganddevelopment/cityplanning" title="jerseycitynj.gov/planning" style="background-color: transparent\; color: rgb(134\, 0\, 0)\;">jerseycitynj.gov/planning.</a></span></p>\n    </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n    <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;"><span class="s1" style="font-family: Arial\, sans-serif\; letter-spacing: 0.25pt\; color: rgb(40\, 40\, 40)\;">To access and download digital plans\, this agenda has hyperlinks below to where you can find digital plans\, reports and other materials for all applications to be presented. Within the agenda\, click on a link for the case you wish to review. Alternatively\, you can search by address or case number to review digital plans at the Jersey City Data Portal.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">\n    <p style="line-height: 1.7em\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\; margin: 0px 0px 15px\;">&nbsp\;</p>\n    </div>\n    </li>\n</ul>
DTEND:20260930T035900Z
DTSTAMP:20260925T222323Z
