DESCRIPTION:<ul style="list-style: none\; margin: 0px\; padding: 0px\; font-size: 14px\;">\n    <li class="CAL-EVENT-cRow" style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238\, 238\, 238)\; padding-bottom: 15px\; margin-bottom: 15px\;">\n    <div class="CAL-EVENT-cR-content" style="padding-left: 15px\;">JCCS Court Outreach Team expands access to court services by offering community events in partnership with local organizations. Individuals may receive assistance finding information about outstanding court cases and fines. Referrals to support services are available on request\, including access to peer support.</div>\n    </li>\n</ul>
