BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/senior-freeze-information-application-assistance-tickets-1999691164102?aff=oddtdtcreator" title="Register Here" style="">Register Here</a></p>\n<p class="p2" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; min-height: 15px\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">&nbsp\;</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">Join Mayor James Solomon for a info-session focused on available property tax relief programs\, including Senior Freeze\, ANCHOR\, and Stay NJ.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">City representatives will be available to explain the Senior Freeze Program\, answer questions\, review eligibility requirements\, and help eligible residents complete and submit their applications.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;"><b>What is Senior Freeze?</b><br>\nThe Senior Freeze Program reimburses eligible homeowners for certain increases in their property taxes by comparing the taxes paid in a qualifying base year with the taxes paid in the current year.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">Residents can also learn more about other available New Jersey property tax relief programs\, including:<br>\n<br>\n<b>ANCHOR</b> — Provides property tax relief to eligible New Jersey homeowners and renters.<br>\n<b>Stay NJ</b> — Provides additional property tax relief for eligible New Jersey seniors.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">Residents seeking application assistance are encouraged to bring relevant documents\, including<br>\n- Proof of age or disability<br>\n- Recent property tax bills<br>\n- Income documentation<br>\n- Social Security information<br>\n- Prior Senior Freeze applications or determination letters.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">This session is free and open to Jersey City residents. Registration is encouraged.</p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;"><b style="">Have Questions? Contact Resident Response Center - 000-000-0000.</b></p>\n<p class="p1" style="margin: 0px\; font-style: normal\; font-variant: normal\; font-size-adjust: none\; font-language-override: normal\; font-kerning: auto\; font-optical-sizing: auto\; font-feature-settings: normal\; font-variation-settings: normal\; font-stretch: normal\; font-size: 13px\; line-height: normal\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;"><font face="Helvetica Neue"><b></b></font></p>
DTEND:20261005T210000Z
