DESCRIPTION:<p><span style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">Third Monday of each month\, 6:30PM (except for holidays) and are open to the public.&nbsp\;</span><br style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">\n<br style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">\n<span style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">June and December Meetings will be held in-person</span><br style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">\n<span style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">Council Caucus Room\, Ground floor\, City Hall\, 280 Grove Street</span><br style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">\n<br style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">\n<span style="font-size: 16px\; letter-spacing: 0.3px\;">January-May and July-November meetings will be held virtually on Teams&nbsp\;<br>\n<span style="font-size:12.0pt\;font-family:&quot\;TimesNewRomanPSMT&quot\;\,serif\;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri\;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin\;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot\;Times New Roman&quot\;\;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi\;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US\;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA"><a href="https://jcnj.org/vstc">https://jcnj.org/vstc</a></span></span></p>
DTEND:20261222T010000Z
